# AI Resume Extractor

## Project Overview

The AI Resume Extractor is a Python-based application designed to identify and extract job-relevant keywords from candidate resume text using an OpenAI-compatible chat API.

The application accepts a resume paragraph, constructs a parameterized prompt, sends it to an AI model, and returns exactly five comma-separated keywords.

## Objectives

- Initialize an OpenAI client using environment-based API credentials.
- Implement the `extract_keywords(text: str) -> str` function.
- Construct a prompt that explicitly demands exactly five comma-separated keywords.
- Submit the prompt to the specified chat model.
- Print the extracted keywords to the console.

